WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:04.950
The night
before
the festival

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.400
3-A MAID CAFE

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.860
The pencil sketch is so much better than I imagined...

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.860
That even I'm creeped out.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.610
Yeah. It's better than the last one.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:17.740
You're really good, Tsutsui!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.990
Thanks. But there's no way
we're gonna finish it by tomorrow.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.240
Yeah...

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.900
You know, this kinda reminds me...

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.860
Oh, of when we painted the welcome banner?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.820
Yeah, that was pretty tough, too.

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.650
We always get stuck doing this stuff.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:45.900
It never changes.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:46.780
Nope.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.110
But you've changed, Tsutsui.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.650
I think you've changed.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:58.150
In a... bad way?

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.030
Why would
you think
that?

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.650
No!

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:02.990
EEK!
EEK!

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.450
Wh-what was that?

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.030
It's just the wind, Tsutsui.

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.280
Still, the school sure is scary at night.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.900
Wanna tell ghost stories?

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:14.780
No, please don't! Unlike you,
I can't play a horror game to save my life-

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:18.650
That sound definitely did not come from the window!

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:19.530
Let's go home!

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.780
And we'll just stay there all day tomorrow!

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.570
What do you mean "stay home," stupid?

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.360
Ishino?

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.030
Why...?

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.400
Because if you don't finish, we're all in trouble.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:38.280
Yo.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:38.280
Hi!
Hey there!

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.200
Aww, I knew you wouldn't be finished.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.030
Seriously, who made him our committee representative?

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.450
Let's get this done.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:51.820
Let me see that.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.900
Hey, snap out of it!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.530
I don't know what to say. Thanks, Ishino-

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.860
Don't want to hear it.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.320
Spare me your grossness.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.820
What I mean
is get to work.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.200
What is this?

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.070
It feels like I'm...

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.650
...having the time of my life.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.950
The time
of my life

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.900
Episode 14
Regarding the Time We Had
Important Roles in the School Festival.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.860
3-A MAID CAFE

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.110
Tadah!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.360
Hey, that's not too bad, Ishino!

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.360
Right?

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.280
Wait, where's Ito?

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.450
What are you hiding for?
Come out and show us what you look like.

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.070
N-no.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.360
Just do it!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.240
I-Ito?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.490
Ito, is that you?!

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:32.990
Don't look at me!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.820
Hey! Don't you go stealing all my thunder!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:38.320
It took me a whole hour to do this makeup!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:41.900
I didn't mean to! I didn't want it to turn out like this!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.740
Excuse me! What are your cheeks
turning all rosy for, YOUNG MAN!

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:50.110
I have an hour before my shift!

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:53.490
As festival rep, I don't think I should leave my class...

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.950
But I have to know how Senpai is doing!

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.610
Welcome...

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.360
Welcome!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.860
Welcome!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.740
This way, please.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.650
I'll take your meal ticket, please.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:12.490
What a beautiful 3D girl...

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.030
Wait.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:17.200
Welcome!

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:19.320
That voice...

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.200
ITO-SENPAI?!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.650
You're pushing yourself pretty hard, aren't you?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.110
Yeah, I am... a little.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.610
But...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.240
Someone worked really hard to make sure
I know how to do this.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:53.610
If I don't do it right, it would be an insult to her.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.110
How very dedicated of you.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.360
Just don't overdo it.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.280
Thanks, Ishino.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.490
A-Ayado...

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.110
I w-was hoping to leave before anybody noticed me...

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.360
Don't look at me!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:14.150
Oh, but, you're so lovely, and cute, and...

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.740
and very handsome!

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.030
Thank you.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.950
It... It's time for my shift!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.150
I have to go cook some potatoes! Let's both do our best!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.110
O-okay! Good luck!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.860
3-A MAID CAFE

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:42.280
Micchan, Micchan, I want to go here! The maid cafe!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:42.990
Huh?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.990
Oh, Master Takanashi!

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:47.280
You came to see me!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.820
I am Ariel the Maid!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:52.700
You're blinding me with those sparkles, Ishino.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.030
What's wrong with you?
Would it kill you to give me a compliment?!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.950
This is pretty hardcore.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.820
We do have two otaku in our class, after all.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.990
And you'll be having my menu contribution,
the Fall Memories Strawberry Parfait

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.110
with added mustard, is that correct?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.200
Don't order for me!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.150
Right away, sir-iel!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.950
3-A MAID CAFE

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.240
She's cute. I wish she could have waited on us.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:15.360
3-A MAID CAFE

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.400
What? But our waitress is cuter! Ariel's awesome!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.820
Really?

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.360
Hey, you're pretty cute.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.240
P-please don't do that!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:28.740
Aww, she's embarrassed. That's adorable!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.650
So cute...

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.990
S-somebody's sexually harassing Ito!

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.740
It's up to you now, General Manager!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:37.820
Huh?

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.490
It's nice that I got out of doing any work for my class.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.610
But now I'm bored.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.490
3-A MAID CAFE

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.950
What the hell?! It was just a little pat on the butt!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.650
Besides, if I'd known he was a dude,
I wouldn't have done it!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.320
That is not the problem we are having, Master.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:02.320
If you cannot be bothered to abide by the rules,
you will cause problems for everyone.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.150
It's just a stupid school festival!
Don't be such a stick in the mud!

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:08.030
"I will not allow this kind of behavior in the cafe

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.780
I gave myself a stomachache building."

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.400
...is what I mean to say, Master.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.070
Now kindly vacate the premises.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.150
Dammit, this place sucks! Ugh!

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:25.950
General Manager!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.490
Nice work, Tsutsui!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.150
That's our General Manager!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.030
Sure, you say that now!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:36.150
You're the ones who said I was just a figurehead
who has to apologize and get beat up

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.360
by the customers when there's trouble, aren't you?

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.740
No, really, you were awesome, Tsutsui!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.200
Thank you, Tsutsui!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.280
Uh, guys...

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.490
You're confusing people! Stop it!

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.820
I'm so tired...

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.320
I just need to recharge.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.360
You look like a different person.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.780
With the winter uniform and the hair.

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:09.110
I haven't seen a mirror, so I don't know how I look.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.030
But it's sticky and uncomfortable.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.200
You sound sleepy.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.990
I was up all night working, so yeah, a little.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.700
What? Don't pass out, okay?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.650
I won't. There's still the beauty contest.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.570
Oh... yeah.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.900
I wonder how it's gonna go...

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.400
Don't worry.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.030
I think we can work it out somehow.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.320
You'll be fine.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.320
You think?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.610
Oh, and they made me the head judge for the contest.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:39.490
What?

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.570
Wait a... what?

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:46.150
Hey! Wake up! Tsutsun!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:50.900
Kodan High School Beauty Contest

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.400
3-A MAID CAFE

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.860
Oh man, I'm tired...

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.780
So tired...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.240
Right now, sales are pretty high,
thanks to Ito's hard work.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:08.530
Tsutsui, we're getting ready to start
setting up for the beauty contest.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:09.740
Okay...

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:14.200
The voting system you made for us is a real life saver.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:14.240
Miss Kodan High Preliminary Vote

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:17.450
It says we have a voter turnout of 85 percent.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.530
How many votes do I have so far?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.450
Harada, Yoko
Ishino, Arisa

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.490
You're in the beauty contest?

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.280
Yeah.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.570
And you thought you stood a chance?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.610
You know Igarashi's in it, too, right?

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.570
You're out of your league-

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:44.030
Don't cry!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.900
You're supposed to have a snappy comeback!

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.110
Don't take it seriously!

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:48.950
Shut up, stupid.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:53.240
I know that I'm not very pretty,
and that boys aren't interested in me.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:59.740
And the one vote I do have is my own!
That's right, laugh! Go on!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.150
I said don't take it seriously.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:11.740
You ARE pretty.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.990
And you were cute in that maid outfit.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:24.400
Miss Kodan Preliminary Vote
Ishino, Arisa

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.990
There. Now you have two votes.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.740
Hang in there, Ishino.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:30.150
What do I do?

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:33.320
Igarashi, Iroha
Akiyama, Reiko

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.950
At this point in time, she's in first place.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.360
She said she didn't want to win.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:38.650
But frankly, I just can't vote for anybody else.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.820
You amaze me.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.990
You're barely even promoting yourself
and you're in first place!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.200
The top four will go on to the finals...

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.820
but it looks like it's basically
going to be down to you and me.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.070
Yeah...

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.240
Just so you know, there is no way I'm going to lose
to a girl who's nothing but a pretty face.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:01.820
Huh? You don't seem like you're any more
than a pretty face yourself...

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.860
Yeah.

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:05.490
Good luck.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:09.030
Full of confidence to the very end.
You are infuriating as usual.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.200
Oh, there you are! Igarashi!

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.610
Congratulations on winning the preliminaries!

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:21.450
You just have to give your speech,
and I know you're going to get first place!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.320
You can do it!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.240
There's something written on your face.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:25.900
Party

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.030
Party
Funds

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:32.150
The beauty pageant finals are about to begin.

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:36.150
Well, I'll do the best I can, anyway.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.820
Yeah! I'm rooting for you!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.070
Thank you very much!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.570
That was Miss Hirata from Class 2-B!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.530
And coming up next...

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.360
We have Miss Reiko Akiyama from Class 3-D!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.490
Coming!

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.400
I'm Reiko Akiyama, from Class 3-D!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:13:01.280
Umm, when I was nominated,
I just knew I wasn't going to win.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.780
I didn't think it was possible for me to even come close.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:08.070
But you all voted for me,

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.150
and now here I am, in the final round.

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.280
It's an honor just being here!

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.860
That conniving little...

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:18.450
Her voice was never that high.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.650
But now that I've made it this far...

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:25.450
since you all voted for me I think it would just be the best
if I could repay you by winning the whole contest!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.740
Thank you all again!

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.700
I have to compete against THAT...?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.990
As a fellow "pretty face,"
should I put in that kind of effort?

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.400
I just don't know anymore.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.610
Good luck!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:43.820
Thanks!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.400
I'll do my best.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.530
Will she be okay?

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.780
Last, but not least!

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:53.400
Miss Igarashi from Class 3-C! If you please!

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:57.740
Umm. I'm Iroha Igarashi.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.650
That girl's really cute, but I hear she's really mean.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.400
Thank you so much to everyone who voted for me!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:12.450
I'm a little nervous, but I'll do my best
to make you want to vote for me again!

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:17.530
Let me see...

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:21.650
My hobby is walking my dog,
and my best dish is boiled eggs.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.570
Nope, I can't keep this up...

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.240
I'm sorry. I don't even have a dog.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:31.150
Whaaaaa?!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.450
Th-that was fast...

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:43.030
I think this business where we judge people based
on what we see on the outside, is really just stupid.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.950
And I don't want to be judged on my looks, either.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.110
Huh?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:53.110
If I've never even talked to you,
I don't care what you think about me.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.570
I know...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.860
I know there are a lot of rumors about me.

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.530
But there are people who see through them.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.990
A precious few who love me for who I am.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:07.650
And if those people like me,
then that's more than enough for me.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.530
So it's okay. I don't need to win.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:16.820
I always knew. My girlfriend...

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.240
...is the best.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:30.150
Student Votes             Judges' Votes
Total Votes
Igarashi, Iroha
Akiyama, Reiko
Neo, Meiko

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.320
We've got the totals.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.360
Akiyama has 737 votes.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.150
And Igarashi has 728. She's nine votes behind.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.700
What? Then...

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.280
So you and your 15 votes will decide the winner,
Mr. Head Judge. Thanks.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.070
Whaaaaat?!

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:41.700
Igarashi, Iroha
Akiyama, Reiko

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.570
Wh-what should I do?

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.740
I want to vote for her, but if I do,
she'll get exactly what she didn't want.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:47.110
But... what's the right answer?

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.150
Who should I vote for?

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.570
I-I will now announce the winner.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.900
The champion and new Miss Kodan High School is...

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.780
So I lost!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.200
Of course I did.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.700
You did your best.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:19.110
That last comment of yours kind of made me laugh.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:25.030
I felt someone as conniving as you would be able
to make all our dreams come true.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:25.700
Huh?

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:28.030
I'm sorry.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:33.200
But I thought that there really is more to you
than just your pretty face.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:38.780
And we all, myself included, know exactly
what makes you such a great person.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:45.740
Then why don't you tell me what makes me so great?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:48.950
Well, you're nice, and...

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:49.860
Uh-huh.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.610
You have inner strength.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.700
Yeah.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.900
You're honest...

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.400
You're actually pretty bashful and awkward with people.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.780
You have a strong sense of justice.

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:04.110
The way you get bad grades,
but you always go to your remedial classes.

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:06.990
The way you fold up your bags
from the corner store so carefully.

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:08.650
The way you can't drink carbonated drinks.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.240
The way you jump a little every time you see a dog.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:12.700
Your build.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:14.950
The beautiful way you hold your chopsticks.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.740
And the other day, when we saw that hearse,
you made sure to-
Note: She made sure to follow the superstition, which in
Japan is to hide your thumbs.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.530
That's enough already, Tsutsun.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:22.450
I have at least 20 more I could list.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.490
Yeah. Tell me next time.

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:27.030
Thanks.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.320
I see them.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:34.490
Don't worry, I see all the good things about you.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.240
Tsutsui!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:47.490
Our maid cafe got first place in sales! We did it!

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:49.070
Wow, that's great!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.450
It was a rocky start,
but I'm glad we made it through okay.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:53.450
Yeah.

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:59.400
Looking back, it was kinda fun, wasn't it?

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.860
Yeah, it was alright.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:06.700
But I'm never, ever, going to be
on the festival committee again.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:07.740
Yeah.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:18.200
Isn't Tsutsun done cleaning up yet?

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:19.860
Igarashi!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.900
Class Rep.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.400
I feel kind of bad.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.240
Oh, that's okay.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:28.360
You were awesome.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:31.320
This is from everyone in class.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:38.950
We all figured you hadn't had any yet.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:40.780
But I...

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.490
Thank you.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.400
Hey, Class Rep.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.610
I know I didn't win the beauty contest...

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.780
but why don't you go tell her anyway?

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:51.950
What?

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.820
Ayado, what are you doing?

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.320
Oh, hello there!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.150
I thought I'd take our scrap wood to put in the campfire.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.240
Let one of the boys do that.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:15.200
Our maid cafe was a big hit.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.820
And it's all thanks to you.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:18.990
That's great.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:24.400
I'll take care of this. You go on to the after party.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:27.280
Oh, no! It's heavy. I'll carry it.

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.530
It's no problem. Give it to me.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.200
H-hot! A spark got me!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.650
What? Are you okay?

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.280
I'm gonna go cool it off!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.780
Why?

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:51.570
All he did was brush my hand,
so why is my heart beating out of my chest?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.280
I'm the one who turned him down.

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:57.570
I can't think of him that way!
I don't have the right to think of him that way!

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.780
I'm so stupid!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.200
Don't get so carried away! Ugh!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.400
Sorry. I got worried.

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:12.490
Did you hear that?

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.030
P-please forget everything!

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:19.150
I'm sorry, I'm so sorry! I really haven't
built up any kind of immunity to-

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:30.780
I don't care if it's an illusion,
or a misunderstanding, or what...

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.320
If touching you like this...

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:39.320
will help you see me as someone you could love...

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.740
I don't see Ito.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:43.780
Yeah...

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.530
You sure you don't want to go to the party?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.240
I'm tired, and I don't think I'd fit in.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:01.570
What's wrong?

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.320
Nothing!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:07.530
I-I bet Ito's tired, too. He might have already gone home.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.610
Come on, we should go!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:09.900
Uh, okay...
